			<div class="content" id="post-content-4116365">
									

<p>Alright, I <em>think</em> that all the files, etc are in the right place now. This is probably the most effort I've ever put into a skip, and I hope that it's enjoyed.</p>
<p>Firstly, massive shoutout to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tsatpwtcotttadc" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3681296); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3681296&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1547254639" alt="TSATPWTCOTTTADC" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3681296)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tsatpwtcotttadc" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3681296); return false;">TSATPWTCOTTTADC</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/pxdnbluesoul" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1414125); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1414125&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1547254639" alt="pxdnbluesoul" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1414125)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/pxdnbluesoul" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1414125); return false;">pxdnbluesoul</a></span>, and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/proasek" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2048131); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2048131&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1547254639" alt="Proasek" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2048131)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/proasek" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2048131); return false;">Proasek</a></span> for doing voices for this skip.</p>
